     fhir:definition [ fhir:v "Example: Jennifer Laskowski, Brandon Renner, Matthew C. Pickering, Natalie J. Serkova, Peter M. Smith-Jones, Eric T. Clambey, Raphael A. Nemenoff, and Joshua M. Thurman." ]
