     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p>This code system \n              <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-disabled-display</code> defines the following codes:\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"codes\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                  <b>Code</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Display</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Definition</b>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">hidden\n                  <a name=\"questionnaire-disabled-display-hidden\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Hidden</td>\n                <td>The item (and its children) should not be visible to the user at all.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">protected\n                  <a name=\"questionnaire-disabled-display-protected\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Protected</td>\n                <td>The item (and possibly its children) should not be selectable or editable but should still be visible - to allow the user to see what questions *could* have been completed had other answers caused the item to be enabled.</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
  ] ; # 
