stionnaireResponse was entered in error and voided.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">stopped\n                  <a name=\"questionnaire-answers-status-stopped\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Stopped</td>\n                <td>This QuestionnaireResponse has been partially filled out with answers but has been abandoned. No subsequent changes can be made.</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
