e defined in additional specifications (though these will not be recognized as 'resources' by the FHIR specification; i.e. they do not get end-points etc., or act as the targets of references in FHIR defined resources - though other specifications can treat them this way).</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">logical\n                  <a name=\"structure-definition-kind-logical\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Logical</td>\n                <td>A pattern or a template that is not intended to be a real resource or complex type.</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
  ] ; # 
