     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p>This code system \n              <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/adverse-event-actuality</code> defines the following codes:\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"codes\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                  <b>Code</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Display</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Definition</b>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">actual\n                  <a name=\"adverse-event-actuality-actual\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Adverse Event</td>\n                <td>The adverse event actually happened regardless of whether anyone was affected or harmed.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">potential\n                  <a name=\"adverse-event-actuality-potential\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Potential Adverse Event</td>\n                <td>A potential adverse event.</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
