     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  385356007 (Tumour stage finding)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  431855005 (Chronic kidney disease stage 1)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  431856006 (Chronic kidney disease stage 2)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  433144002 (Chronic kidney disease stage 3)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  431857002 (Chronic kidney disease stage 4)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  433146000 (Chronic kidney disease stage 5)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  408847006 (Retinopathy of prematurity stage 1 - demarcation line)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  408848001 (Retinopathy of prematurity stage 2 - intraretinal ridge)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  408849009 (Retinopathy of prematurity stage 3 - ridge with extraretinal fibrovascular proliferation)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  408850009 (Retinopathy of prematurity stage 4 - subtotal retinal detachment)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  408851008 (Retinopathy of prematurity stage 5 - total retinal detachment)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/416780008\">416780008</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>Primary degenerative dementia of the Alzheimer type, presenile onset (disorder)</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include these codes as defined in \n           