  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include codes from \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.1.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code>\n                </a> where concept  is-a  \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.1.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-_ParticipationAncillary\">_ParticipationAncillary</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include all codes defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.1.0/CodeSystem-participant-type.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/participant-type</code>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>This value set excludes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Exclude these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.1.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code>\n                </a>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Definition</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.1.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-_ParticipationAncillary\">_ParticipationAncillary</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>ParticipationAncillary</td>\n                    <td>Participations related, but not primary to an act. The Referring, Admitting, and Discharging practitioners must be the same person as those authoring the ControlAct event for their respective trigger events.</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
  ] ; # 
